#! expect a 440 special 14 form 0
#! expect b 450 damage 26.000
#! expect a 600 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 608 damage 33.000
#! expect b 668 damage 34.000 hitlag 0 hitstun 0
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
